('ecto-protection','Ecto Protection','metacreativity',NULL,'1 standard action; see text','standard','Close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)','An astral construct you manifest',NULL,NULL,'1 min./level',NULL,'None','no',NULL,1,'Reinforce an astral construct against dispelling and dismiss ectoplasm; it can be manifested swiftly with the construct under the stated PP limit.','For every 2 additional PP, improve both protective bonuses by 1.'),
